1
00:00:22,810 --> 00:00:26,694
♪The night wind shakes off
the withered leaves♪

2
00:00:29,094 --> 00:00:33,709
♪I open the window and gaze at the moon♪

3
00:00:35,582 --> 00:00:40,720
♪Haze spreads across the river,
lanterns drifting♪

4
00:00:42,058 --> 00:00:47,067
♪I hear the memories rustling♪

5
00:00:48,278 --> 00:00:51,199
♪Garden flowers shed petals one by one♪

6
00:00:51,410 --> 00:00:54,501
♪Candlelight flickers,
swaying with melancholy♪

7
00:00:54,798 --> 00:00:59,033
♪I sigh by the lamp over the long night♪

8
00:01:01,018 --> 00:01:03,926
♪Past memories unfold scene by scene♪

9
00:01:04,224 --> 00:01:07,110
♪It's all your face♪

10
00:01:07,420 --> 00:01:12,202
♪Boldly trampling over my heart♪

11
00:01:12,202 --> 00:01:16,782
♪Two measures of ink I take,
one for love miswritten♪

12
00:01:16,782 --> 00:01:18,781
♪And another for youth passed♪

13
00:01:18,984 --> 00:01:24,766
♪With endless sorrow,
I once traced your silhouette♪

14
00:01:25,150 --> 00:01:29,461
♪Two measures of ink I take,
one for joy and sorrow♪

15
00:01:29,461 --> 00:01:31,969
♪And another for parting and reunion♪

16
00:01:32,215 --> 00:01:42,432
♪I write until splendor fades,
and I am no more♪

17
00:01:45,882 --> 00:01:48,716
=Prelude of the White Snake=

18
00:01:48,716 --> 00:01:51,634
=Episode 19=

19
00:02:07,480 --> 00:02:09,719
Then why not marry me first?

20
00:02:10,159 --> 00:02:12,280
I can help you get your revenge.
How about that?

21
00:02:13,240 --> 00:02:14,240
No.

22
00:02:14,639 --> 00:02:15,639
I can't hold you back.

23
00:02:22,159 --> 00:02:23,639
I've found a lead on my enemy.

24
00:02:23,879 --> 00:02:24,879
I'll avenge them soon.

25
00:02:28,800 --> 00:02:29,960
Wishful thinking.

26
00:02:30,520 --> 00:02:32,560
You can never pull off
the revenge alone.

27
00:02:39,759 --> 00:02:41,159
I never thought you'd doubt me.

28
00:02:54,319 --> 00:02:55,879
Suzhen's snake spirit didn't react.

29
00:02:56,560 --> 00:02:57,719
She really isn't Suzhen.

30
00:02:59,319 --> 00:03:00,560
I never expected that demon

31
00:03:00,560 --> 00:03:02,520
could conceal her aura so well.

32
00:03:02,520 --> 00:03:04,039
Even Qing didn't notice.

33
00:03:04,960 --> 00:03:06,319
That means she's very powerful.

34
00:03:08,400 --> 00:03:10,120
I wonder how Miss Bai's been tortured.

35
00:03:15,240 --> 00:03:16,240
You worry about her?

36
00:03:22,159 --> 00:03:23,960
I just want to uncover
the truth quickly.

37
00:03:28,840 --> 00:03:29,919
How about I go beat her up

38
00:03:30,199 --> 00:03:31,719
until she tells us where Suzhen is?

39
00:03:34,599 --> 00:03:35,599
Don't be rash.

40
00:03:35,800 --> 00:03:37,120
She could even hurt Suzhen.

41
00:03:37,120 --> 00:03:38,840
You're probably no match for her either.

42
00:03:40,759 --> 00:03:41,759
What else can we do?

43
00:03:47,159 --> 00:03:49,319
Well, Jinshan Temple
has a kind of powder.

44
00:03:49,759 --> 00:03:50,759
I have an idea.

45
00:03:53,960 --> 00:03:54,960
What powder?

46
00:03:55,199 --> 00:03:57,520
We can put the powder in the flatbreads

47
00:03:57,759 --> 00:03:58,960
and have her eat it.

48
00:04:24,759 --> 00:04:26,879
Looking in the mirror again, Suzhen?

49
00:04:32,480 --> 00:04:33,480
Apologize.

50
00:04:37,480 --> 00:04:38,680
Aunt made some flatbreads.

51
00:04:39,079 --> 00:04:40,079
Try one.

52
00:04:44,319 --> 00:04:45,319
Apologize.

53
00:04:48,160 --> 00:04:50,839
It was my fault earlier today.

54
00:04:51,639 --> 00:04:52,639
I'm sorry.

55
00:04:54,959 --> 00:04:57,319
That's right. Aunt and I
gave him a good scolding.

56
00:04:59,160 --> 00:05:00,720
Aunt was right.

57
00:05:01,639 --> 00:05:04,120
We should set our wedding date
as soon as possible.

58
00:05:05,439 --> 00:05:07,000
Did Aunt really say that?

59
00:05:09,680 --> 00:05:10,959
Aunt is the best.

60
00:05:11,759 --> 00:05:12,759
Try the flatbreads.

61
00:05:12,959 --> 00:05:13,959
They're delicious.

62
00:05:15,519 --> 00:05:16,879
Aunt made these herself?

63
00:05:23,519 --> 00:05:25,079
Anything Aunt makes is delicious.

64
00:05:36,079 --> 00:05:37,079
Is it good?

65
00:05:39,199 --> 00:05:40,199
Yes.

66
00:05:42,519 --> 00:05:43,519
You have some too.

67
00:05:44,199 --> 00:05:45,480
- We already ate.
- We had some.

68
00:06:39,720 --> 00:06:41,560
What did you put in the flatbreads?

69
00:06:42,240 --> 00:06:44,959
Tell me, where is Suzhen?

70
00:06:45,240 --> 00:06:46,519
Where did you hide Suzhen?

71
00:06:49,920 --> 00:06:53,240
I didn't expect
you'd find out after all.

72
00:06:55,040 --> 00:06:57,879
If you're so capable,
find her yourselves!

73
00:07:18,000 --> 00:07:19,240
Don't you dare run away!

74
00:07:19,240 --> 00:07:20,560
I'll teach you a lesson!

75
00:07:24,959 --> 00:07:25,959
Don't interfere.

76
00:07:25,959 --> 00:07:26,959
Saving Suzhen comes first.

77
00:07:28,160 --> 00:07:29,199
You know where she is?

78
00:07:54,040 --> 00:07:55,040
Qing!

79
00:07:58,480 --> 00:07:59,480
Are you alright?

80
00:08:09,360 --> 00:08:10,519
The seal was just reinforced.

81
00:08:10,519 --> 00:08:11,519
It's hard to break.

82
00:08:11,720 --> 00:08:12,839
What about another way?

83
00:08:13,600 --> 00:08:14,839
I can't think of any other way.

84
00:08:44,919 --> 00:08:46,919
Forcing the Du'e Ancient Scroll
to work for you

85
00:08:46,919 --> 00:08:48,080
will turn back on you harder.

86
00:08:48,919 --> 00:08:50,039
I can't worry about that now.

87
00:08:50,679 --> 00:08:52,679
We've exposed
the black snake's true form.

88
00:08:54,120 --> 00:08:55,360
I must hurry and rescue Suzhen

89
00:08:55,360 --> 00:08:56,440
before she recovers.

90
00:09:20,799 --> 00:09:22,200
Have you lost your mind, Xu Xian?

91
00:09:46,720 --> 00:09:47,960
You and Qing guard the entrance

92
00:09:48,320 --> 00:09:49,840
so we don't get trapped inside.

93
00:09:53,639 --> 00:09:54,639
I'll be right back.

94
00:09:56,320 --> 00:09:57,320
Xu Xian!

95
00:09:59,200 --> 00:10:00,200
Be careful.

96
00:10:32,440 --> 00:10:34,799
My lord, I have failed the mission.

97
00:10:35,159 --> 00:10:37,399
The mural world
was sealed by Jinshan Temple.

98
00:10:37,559 --> 00:10:40,279
T-They even severely injured me as well.

99
00:10:44,080 --> 00:10:45,080
Useless!

100
00:10:46,799 --> 00:10:48,159
You can't even do that right.

101
00:10:48,759 --> 00:10:49,799
What good are you?

102
00:10:51,000 --> 00:10:53,919
But I managed to bring out
the remaining demonic energy

103
00:10:53,919 --> 00:10:54,919
for you to use, my lord.

104
00:11:29,399 --> 00:11:30,399
Good girl.

105
00:11:31,440 --> 00:11:34,559
It wasn't in vain that I nurtured you
with my breath for years.

106
00:11:35,080 --> 00:11:36,080
Remember this.

107
00:11:36,919 --> 00:11:40,440
As long as you help me
escape this Jinshan array soon,

108
00:11:41,039 --> 00:11:43,080
I won't mistreat you.

109
00:11:44,919 --> 00:11:46,840
Had you not helped me be reborn

110
00:11:47,200 --> 00:11:48,200
and raised me for years,

111
00:11:48,679 --> 00:11:49,960
I wouldn't be who I am today.

112
00:11:50,399 --> 00:11:52,960
I will go through fire and water for you

113
00:11:52,960 --> 00:11:54,120
without hesitation.

114
00:11:55,600 --> 00:11:57,559
Come, I'll heal your wounds.

115
00:12:35,080 --> 00:12:36,080
Suzhen!

116
00:12:47,759 --> 00:12:48,759
Suzhen!

117
00:12:51,279 --> 00:12:52,279
Xu Xian.

118
00:12:52,679 --> 00:12:54,080
You're hurt. Don't move.

119
00:12:55,960 --> 00:12:56,960
Let me help you up.

120
00:13:21,240 --> 00:13:24,039
I'm sorry. I lied to you.

121
00:13:26,919 --> 00:13:27,919
Don't speak.

122
00:13:29,600 --> 00:13:30,879
Let me get you out first.

123
00:14:01,879 --> 00:14:02,919
Suzhen, you're awake.

124
00:14:09,200 --> 00:14:10,200
Don't move.

125
00:14:10,720 --> 00:14:11,720
You're injured.

126
00:14:13,840 --> 00:14:15,000
You're finally awake.

127
00:14:15,960 --> 00:14:16,960
If you hadn't woken up,

128
00:14:16,960 --> 00:14:19,799
he would've emptied Jinshan Temple's
entire medicine stash.

129
00:14:21,919 --> 00:14:24,600
Suzhen, what on earth happened
inside the mural?

130
00:14:27,279 --> 00:14:28,279
Actually,

131
00:14:29,720 --> 00:14:30,960
the one who took me that day

132
00:14:32,360 --> 00:14:33,480
wasn't Changming.

133
00:14:38,279 --> 00:14:39,360
Who would've thought

134
00:14:40,840 --> 00:14:42,360
that even inside the mural world,

135
00:14:42,919 --> 00:14:45,080
you'd still have
such abundant spiritual power?

136
00:14:45,559 --> 00:14:46,559
Who exactly are you?

137
00:14:59,480 --> 00:15:01,039
Why did you take my form?

138
00:15:01,399 --> 00:15:03,120
What do you mean, "take your form"?

139
00:15:04,440 --> 00:15:05,559
I have been you all along.

140
00:15:06,159 --> 00:15:07,159
What do you mean?

141
00:15:08,360 --> 00:15:09,600
Have you forgotten?

142
00:15:24,679 --> 00:15:25,759
Since you've forgotten,

143
00:15:25,960 --> 00:15:27,279
let me help you remember.

144
00:15:31,000 --> 00:15:33,720
Come on, become a part of me.

145
00:15:46,799 --> 00:15:49,120
The mural world kept absorbing
my spiritual power,

146
00:15:50,080 --> 00:15:51,399
so I couldn't defeat her

147
00:15:52,120 --> 00:15:53,960
and was imprisoned in the dungeon.

148
00:15:55,200 --> 00:15:56,200
But

149
00:15:57,440 --> 00:15:59,000
during our fight,

150
00:16:01,120 --> 00:16:02,600
I regained my lost memories.

151
00:16:05,879 --> 00:16:07,519
Suzhen, you remember everything?

152
00:16:12,120 --> 00:16:15,720
Was it you
who killed my parents back then?

153
00:16:47,236 --> 00:16:51,395
♪I also gave my youth to someone♪

154
00:16:53,862 --> 00:16:58,240
♪I must admit, you made the journey♪

155
00:16:59,783 --> 00:17:05,608
♪When loving you
became instinct, what's left♪

156
00:17:06,377 --> 00:17:10,844
♪Seals a fate too brutal to amend♪

157
00:17:13,709 --> 00:17:18,150
♪Clumsy and new, we gave our first kiss♪

158
00:17:20,346 --> 00:17:25,076
♪Never thought passionate eyes
would turn cold♪

159
00:17:26,288 --> 00:17:32,401
♪I thought of pulling away,
but I'd barely begun♪

160
00:17:33,064 --> 00:17:38,846
♪Having loved you so deep,
how could I love another♪

161
00:17:38,846 --> 00:17:45,109
♪Even if we're strangers again,
why deny we loved♪

162
00:17:45,419 --> 00:17:51,778
♪Though I'm stubborn,
I never stopped you from loving others♪

163
00:17:51,949 --> 00:17:59,316
♪I shouldn't have been so foolish
to think there was still hope♪

164
00:17:59,601 --> 00:18:05,148
♪But you won't even admit what we had♪

165
00:18:05,639 --> 00:18:11,849
♪Even if we're strangers again,
why deny we loved♪

166
00:18:12,159 --> 00:18:18,932
♪Though I have questions,
I never questioned you♪

167
00:18:19,929 --> 00:18:25,582
♪I'll lock you away and set myself free♪

168
00:18:26,416 --> 00:18:30,824
♪After all, I'm the one you deny♪

169
00:18:31,589 --> 00:18:34,177
♪Having ever loved♪
